<strong>=Other Changes & Additions=</strong>
-You can now view the Quest Journal in the Quest Menu Sidebar. (Big thanks to Ron!)
-You can now edit Nicknames in the Options Menu Sidebar. (Big thanks to Ron!)
-Both of the above can still also be edited in the Bedroom.
-You can now Loosen and Unloosen your Ties in the Closet. (Big thanks to Ron!)
-You can now Button and Unbutton your Preston School Shirt in the Closet. (Big thanks to Ron!)
-New Avatar Background for Backyards! (Big thanks to Phlixel!)
-You can now Toggle the Bedroom Background in the Player's Bedromo. (Big thanks to Ron!)
-The shops now have a Shopping Cart to make buying multiple items easier. (Big thanks to Ron!)
-Store Clothing items have been alphabetized. (Big thanks to Ron!)